This directory contains sequence files used to test the sequence executor.
They have been hand editited, not generated by the OT so the do not test
whether the sequence executor is correctly interpreting OT sequence
descriptions.

tcstest1.xml	1 arcsec telescope movements with P1 guiding
tcstest2.xml	as tcstest1 but with P2 guiding
tcstest3.xml	as tcstest1 but with the OIWFS guiding.
tcstest4.xml	20 arcsec telescope movements with P1 guiding
tcstest5.xml	as tcstest1 but with P2 guiding
tcstest6.xml	as tcstest1 but with the OIWFS guiding.
tcstest7.xml	5 arcmin offset and back with PWFS1 frozen for the offset.
tcstest8.xml	as tcstest7 but with P2
tcstest9.xml	as tcstest7 but with OIWFS
tcstest10.xml	as tcstest7 but parking instead of freezing
tcstest11.xml	as tcstest10 but parking instead of freezing
tcstest12.xml	as tcstest11 but parking instead of freezing
tcstest13.xml	switches guiding from P1 to P2 and back
tcstest14.xml	as tcstest13 but using P1 and the OIWFS
tcstest15.xml	as tcstest13 but using P2 and the OIWFS

actest1.xml	A single 10s exposure with the acquisition camera
actest2.xml	A series of exposures with different filters
actest3.xml	As actest2 but with a different offset for exposure
actest4.xml	Test of different observe types

niritest1.xml	A single 10s exposure with NIRI
